        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Refines the <code class=\"notranslate\">pr-check-lint_content</code>:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Move only Markdown files, ignoring any non-Markdown files.</li>\n<li>Run the workflow on <code class=\"notranslate\">pull_request</code> if the workflow itself gets changed.</li>\n<li>Lint Markdown files in the root directory.</li>\n<li>Separate tools into different steps, with diff after each step.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Avoid unintended side-effects of non-Markdown files on linting tools.</li>\n<li>Ensure workflow regressions are noticed before merging changes.</li>\n<li>Ensure workflow runs properly on PRs that only touch root Markdown files.</li>\n<li>Make it easier to identify which tool introduced a change.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/actions/runs/21840361319/job/63022712540?pr=43073\">this test run</a> with example changes (<a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/92ef06c54d72a85211e3ad07085141969ef361ce/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/92ef06c54d72a85211e3ad07085141969ef361ce\"><tt>92ef06c</tt></a>).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
