        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Currently, all WebDriver reference documentation exists at the root level (<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/tree/main/files/en-us/web/webdriver/reference\"><code class=\"notranslate\">/Web/WebDriver/Reference</code></a>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Creates a new directory for \"classic\" docs under <code class=\"notranslate\">webdriver/reference</code>.</li>\n<li>Moves existing reference docs to <code class=\"notranslate\">webdriver/reference/classic</code>.</li>\n<li>Updates the WebDriver sidebar to reflect these changes.</li>\n<li>Cleans up the landing pages.</li>\n<li>Ensures all page titles reflect the \"classic\" context.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>To classify the current docs as classic</li>\n<li>To reorganize existing directory structure before we add more classic reference pages for commands etc</li>\n<li>To prepare for the addition of BiDi content</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">BCD already organizes the compat data by:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/tree/main/webdriver/classic\">classic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/tree/main/webdriver/bidi\">bidi</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related links</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Classic spec: <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/</a></li>\n<li>BiDi spec: <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Sidebar screenshots</h3>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Current</th>\n<th>With this PR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/546413366-ce80d64e-266b-4704-9a3a-813eac06b02b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..vsEOUw2hyZsISDeVz3wHWHWKOm5QH9-PFgS9lByBF3Q\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"230\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-06 at 3 43 45 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/546413366-ce80d64e-266b-4704-9a3a-813eac06b02b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..vsEOUw2hyZsISDeVz3wHWHWKOm5QH9-PFgS9lByBF3Q\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 230px;\"></a></kbd></td>\n<td><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/546413489-a12b3321-5b80-45d6-a6ca-82fa28f87472.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..quDYgfi2mB3wvTx11_pXQtbQdxv2IlsuXM6EG-Ap4ms\"><img width=\"190\" height=\"255\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-06 at 3 42 41 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/546413489-a12b3321-5b80-45d6-a6ca-82fa28f87472.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..quDYgfi2mB3wvTx11_pXQtbQdxv2IlsuXM6EG-Ap4ms\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 255px;\"></a></kbd></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>",
