        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>New pages</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">/en-US/docs/Web/API/Audio_Session_API</code> - API landing page</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">/en-US/docs/Web/API/AudioSession</code> - Interface page</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">/en-US/docs/Web/API/AudioSession/type</code> - The <code class=\"notranslate\">type</code> property</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/audioSession</code> - Navigator property</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Updated pages</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator</code> - Added <code class=\"notranslate\">audioSession</code> to the list of standard properties</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Updated data files</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">files/jsondata/GroupData.json</code> - Added \"Audio Session API\" entry for sidebar generation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Document Audio Session API <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-16_4-release-notes#:~:text=Added%20support%20for%20a%20subset%20of%20the%20AudioSession%20Web%20API\" rel=\"nofollow\">supported since Safari 16.4</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-16_4-release-notes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safari 16.4 release notes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/main/api/AudioSession.json\">BCD: AudioSession</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/main/api/Navigator.json#L329\">BCD: Navigator.audioSession</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2684558225\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/36932\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/36932/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/36932\">#36932</a></li>\n</ul>",
