        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136667416?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Fix the sample workflow in [CONTRIBUTING.md:339-346] by correcting the branch name used in the git push --set-upstream example.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The section walks contributors through deleting the /Learn/Accessibility tree and explicitly creates a branch named deleting-a11y. The push command mistakenly referenced moving-a11y, which could cause confusion for newcomers following the instructions literally.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Why</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Keeps the documentation accurate and consistent for first-time contributors.<br>\nPrevents contributors from thinking they made a mistake or from pushing to a differently named branch than the one created earlier in the same example.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Testing</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Checked git diff upstream/main...HEAD to confirm this branch diverges only by the corrected line.<br>\nVerified no other files were touched.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42972",
            "title": "docs: fix branch name in delete example",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-08T07:23:54.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-29T16:15:46.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "pranjal2004838",
                "url": "https://github.com/pranjal2004838"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add documentation for the new <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.getVersion()</code> method, supported on Chrome 143+[1], Safari 26.2[2][3]. Firefox does not support it yet[4]. Cross-link with other files. Update related sections in other documents.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This method was created in W3C WECG as a standard way to access extension version, and an alternative to implementation-dependent runtime.getManifest().version[5][6]</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Sources:<br>\n[1] <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/runtime#method-getVersion\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/runtime#method-getVersion</a><br>\n[2] <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes</a><br>\n[3] <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3481883150\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/51763\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/51763/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/51763\">WebKit/WebKit#51763</a><br>\n[4] <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1992418\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1992418</a><br>\n[5] <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3465982582\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/878\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/878/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/878\">w3c/webextensions#878</a><br>\n[6] <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1735060999\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/400\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/400/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/400\">w3c/webextensions#400</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Companion BCD PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3872090939\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28942\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28942/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28942\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28942</a><br>\nCompanion BCD data released in 7.3.1: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/releases/tag/v7.3.1\">https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/releases/tag/v7.3.1</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
